{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>據 Counterpoint Research，Apple 在中國雙十一購物節期間位居智能手機市場首位，銷售按年下跌 8%；同期整體市場銷售下跌 17%。該機構將促銷期界定為第 42 至 46 周。</p>\n<h2>六款 iPhone 打入十大</h2>\n<p>在十大暢銷型號中，六款為 iPhone 17 及 iPhone 18 型號，其中 <a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-18-Pro/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone 18 Pro</a> Max 排名最高，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/tag/iPhone-Duo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 則位列第九。</p>\n<h2>華為唯一主要品牌增長</h2>\n<p>華為是期內唯一錄得增長的主要品牌，銷售上升 29%。Counterpoint 表示，在 iPhone 18 Pro 於中國開售初期銷情強勁之後，消費者正推遲換機，而非接受更高價格。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 Apple 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"738\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/apple-logo.jpg\" width=\"1312\"/></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://counterpointresearch.com/en/insights/china-double-11-smartphone-sales-drop-17-percent-on-weak-demand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">消息來源</a></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:54.070969+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:46:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T17:57:47.883783+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:24.763022+00:00","content_hash":"4a7eb1644f620b8bc0950b910fa1402bc96cd35ae3393d7a36464e408bd3c4a5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}